WEBVTT

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:42.740
<b>7: 36 Rebels</b>

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:51.680
Your kitaigen style and my Tsuutenroku 
were bait to draw out Zensei.

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:54.580
And once they take the bait,

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:59.920
we'll be able to round up all 
of them here at Ryuukosan.

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:05.320
You're welcome to fight here at Ryuukosan,

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:08.660
but I expect you to pay 
for anything you break.

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:12.630
It'll be fine. Rikukin's family has money.

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:15.260
And the Express Delivery 
Company is state-run.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.770
Don't worry.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:19.880
Don't joke about that, Tenshi.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:23.030
We're not that big a deal.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:31.420
In any case, if we work together, 
we'll be able to deal Zensei a fatal blow.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.960
It's the perfect opportunity.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.850
We'll be sure not to make any mistakes.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:40.820
Well, we should get going.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:42.510
Soran, let's go.

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:44.520
Master!

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:45.390
Soran-kun?

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:47.600
Please tell me!

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:53.220
Ro Ji told me my grandfather 
was connected to Zensei.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:58.280
Was my grandfather a heretic like Zensei?

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:05.230
You said you couldn't tell me the truth until
I earned the right to become the Tenshi.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:08.870
But I must know this, no matter what.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:19.260
Tenshi, just how far will you 
back this boy into a corner?

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:24.270
If you won't tell him, 
I'll tell him everything.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.590
You don't mind, do you?

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:31.880
Rinron, the rest of you go outside.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:51.070
Soran, it's true that your grandfather 
was connected to the heretics of Zensei.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:55.450
Furthermore, he even became 
one of their sworn brothers.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.850
At the time, not only Chou Kaigi,

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:05.350
but other outsiders of famous schools 
also swore their allegiance to Zensei.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:11.230
You mustn't eavesdrop on the grandmasters!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:14.450
Things are just getting good! Be quiet!

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.960
This is Grandfather's technique!

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:21.950
We're sorry!

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:27.180
You can use ki techniques 
without performing the ritual.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:31.170
Looks like you've truly made 
the Tsuutenroku your own.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:34.950
No, I still have much to learn.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:39.390
Soran, the man who created Tsuutenroku

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:43.870
was my friend Jou Shifu of 
the Bouzan Jousei Sect.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:47.500
He was a sworn brother of Zensei, as well.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:48.680
What?

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.560
Jou Shifu, Chou Kaigi,

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:56.540
Tengekai chairman Fuu Chonhao's 
grandfather Fuu Tenyou, and others.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:02.120
A total of 36 men swore fealty to Zensei.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:06.830
That's why they're known as the 36 Rebels.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:07.030
<b>36 Rebels</b>

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:10.860
The leaders of the various 
styles were deeply troubled.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:18.200
After all, they never dreamed their students 
would ally themselves with Zensei.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:25.260
Eventually, they united and ordered 
the destruction of the 36 Rebels.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.660
A punitive order?

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:29.220
So you joined the force?

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:30.970
That's right.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:37.020
Den Shinchuu and I went after Kaigi.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.490
Fool!

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:46.370
Despite all my emphasis on secrecy, 
you spilled the beans to Shinchuu!

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:48.360
How can you be so loose-lipped?

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.930
I'm sorry, Master.

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:55.030
Master, I forced Jiiei-senpai to tell me.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.810
It's not his fault.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:06:00.270
Master, allow me to be direct.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.810
Do you have no intention of 
protecting Kaigi's life?

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.520
Protecting?

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:10.380
I've fulfilled my duty by 
rejecting the punitive order.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:14.220
We can't call off the order.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:19.170
Any more, and we'd make enemies of 
outsiders all across the globe.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:23.670
For now, we must come together 
to overcome this national crisis.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:27.170
This is no time to be 
having internal disputes.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:32.900
But what if we secretly 
brought Kaigi back to us?

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:35.620
Could the Tenshifu protect him?

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:40.710
What happens here at Ryuukosan can only 
be judged by the laws of the Tenshi.

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:45.620
I won't allow anyone to harm 
a student on this mountain.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:52.470
If that idiot returns, then I'll draw him 
over the coals according to the law.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:55.590
Master.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:58.970
We will bring Kaigi back.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:00.460
Please let us go.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:06.690
Our master was a just man 
who cared for his students.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:11.400
That night, the Tenshi and I 
secretly descended the mountain.

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:14.910
We split up to search for Kaigi.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:19.100
Hane-chan, give me a hand.

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.190
Yes, Grandmaster.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:26.670
While searching for Kaigi, I was attacked.

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:30.760
I still don't know who my attackers were.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:36.230
They captured me and demanded 
to know where Kaigi was.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:44.750
I survived, but I was unable to find Kaigi.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:48.260
I see.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.220
So that's what happened.

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:53.370
Because of my grandfather...

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:59.600
Soran, we understood Kaigi.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:03.910
He's always cared for his friends.

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:09.720
He must've thought we'd be in harm's 
way if he returned to Ryuukosan,

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:14.710
so he chose to hide alone and keep running.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.880
It's not his fault.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.160
Master Den!

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:25.100
But you...

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:31.100
I had no idea about any of this!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:35.580
With no relatives, 
Kaigi had no one to lean on.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:39.490
It's no wonder he didn't tell you.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:43.170
Honestly, Kaigi...

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:50.990
If only you'd returned here, 
Soran wouldn't have had a hard life.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.830
Soran.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:58.000
We don't resent him.

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.090
Master!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.220
Raise your head, Soran.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:11.790
No matter how this tournament turns 
out, you're still our grandson.

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:15.830
Unbelievable. What a farce.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.310
Den-san, Tenshi.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:22.150
You're lucky to have gained this grandson.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:27.570
From now on, the Tenshifu is your home.

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:35.920
Hey, miss. What were you 
talking about in there?

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.420
Hey, wait!

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.440
I know you heard me! Don't ignore me!

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:52.330
I remember now.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:55.910
You're tournament participant Fuu Houhou.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:59.330
I'm on edge because I just lost my match,

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:00.910
so this is perfect.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.400
I'll take out my frustrations on you!

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:04.610
Prepare yourself!

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:06.030
What's all this commotion?

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.030
Oh, just, um...

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.260
Hey, stop!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:13.240
That hurts!

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:13.660
Houhou!

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:15.960
Stop, Hou-nee!

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.170
Haven't you done enough?

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.630
Hou-nee!

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:24.980
Houhou, what's gotten into you?

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:29.160
I'm not sure.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.040
I don't know.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:43.220
It's okay. I understand.

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:46.810
You have a home to return to, too.

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.740
I promise we'll find it.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:52.210
Okay.

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:56.290
Hey, Rinron.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:59.510
Have you told Soran about that yet?

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:01.690
What? I could never tell him!

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:03.500
My grandfather's here!

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:06.550
Well, we should get going.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.970
Chou Soran!

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:18.400
Chou Soran, wait.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.520
Y-You're not here to 
settle a score, are you?

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:23.860
No, it's not that.

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.830
Um, I...

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.700
Uh...

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.310
I can't!

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.020
How could I ever say this?

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.590
Hana-chan, you say it!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.670
What? Why me?

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.840
Tell him, tell him, tell him!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.020
Out of the way, you cowards!

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:45.250
Niken-san, you'll tell him?

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.860
Look at you, playing innocent.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.560
If you two won't do it, I will.

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:53.430
Niken-san, you're so cool!

00:11:58.490 --> 00:11:59.500
Chou Soran.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.040
This is a serious request.

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.080
Wh-What is it?

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:08.230
Show me your ****.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:13.550
What did you say?

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.090
You asshole.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.160
You think I swing that way?

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:21.740
LIke hell I'm gonna fulfill that request!

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:23.670
Now, now. Calm down.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:23.090
Kinkouju!

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:24.810
You misunderstand me.

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:28.460
We're not interested in your ****.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:31.340
We just want to see the seal engraved there.

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:34.240
What? On my ****?!

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:37.190
That's just another misunderstanding.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.480
You making fun of my ****?

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:41.980
Insult me all you want, 
but I won't let you insult my ****!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:41.980
I'm not! I'm just interested, that's all!

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:42.940
You piece of shit!

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:46.110
Listen to us, Chou Soran.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.700
We're not just asking out of curiosity.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.100
Seals are forbidden nowadays.

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:54.200
It's an incredible technique 
not described in any text.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:55.330
That's right.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.230
We just want to study a lost art up close.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.320
We don't have any impure intentions.

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:02.330
Right, right.

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:07.170
Oh, well, you should've just said so.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:10.770
Please grant our request, Soran-sama!

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.940
In that case, let me show you.

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:13.970
Hooray!

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.410
You really think I'd say that?

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:16.690
Aww!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.060
If you're so curious, go ask the Tenshi.

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:23.860
A master as incredible as him 
must have an amazing one.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:28.600
Why not show them, huh? It's no big deal.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:29.940
It <i>is</i> a big deal.

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:31.240
Uh, excuse me...

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.000
Huh?

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:38.160
Our request aside, there is 
another reason we stopped you.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.330
What is it?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.470
It's a full moon tonight.

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:45.480
We thought we'd have a 
party and invite everyone.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:46.960
What do you think?

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.460
A party? What the hell?

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.620
I'm sure it's some kind of obsc—

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:54.270
We'll be there.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.450
Soran would be happy to go, too.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:00.530
We can't turn down an invitation from a girl.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.460
Let's go.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:05.330
Houhou.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.630
Go with him.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:16.740
No matter what anyone says, Rinron-chan won.

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:23.310
I never thought we'd be drinking 
together, Reigyoku-sama.

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:27.450
Why not come to Sekkou sometime?
I'll show you around.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:29.250
So this is how everyone acts 
when there's no match.

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:33.290
Everyone wants to talk to you.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.790
Huh? But...

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:36.680
What are you getting nervous for?

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:38.130
Come on, walk.

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:39.180
Hurry.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.180
Hey!

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:42.080
Hou-nee, I'm joining the party!

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:43.610
Guys, Soran is here!

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:45.860
Took you long enough!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:46.940
Houhou.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.490
You can go with him.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:52.740
Wouldn't it be better to 
keep her away from others?

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:55.780
Dad used to say the same thing.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:15:00.030
He wouldn't let Houhou interact 
with anyone other than us.

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:03.590
But don't you feel bad for Houhou?

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:08.410
You might be right.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:09.590
Go on.

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:13.780
Don't worry about them.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:20.690
You're not too bad.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:24.000
You've been winning without 
fighting a single match.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:26.600
Impressive work, shameless one.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:29.550
Wanna know what your odds are now?

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.120
Kind of.

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.580
250%!

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:35.110
Really? I'm amazing!

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:39.320
So what trick did you use to beat Zen Shidou?

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:41.040
Chou Soran, huh? He's interesting.

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:42.510
I didn't use any tricks.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:45.580
I heard you fought him once.

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:48.140
Was he as underhanded as they say?

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.770
I don't want to talk about him.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:52.830
Really? Why not?

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:55.010
Is it true you don't like him?

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:56.810
Not so.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.650
Really?

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:02.780
Does this have something 
to do with your Ingorai?

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:04.070
Silence.

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:06.220
Sounds like I'm right.

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:09.830
I'm not interested in this conversation.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.560
Excuse me.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.440
So, what is it actually?

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.910
Come on, Reigyoku.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.510
Are you really that jealous of Soran?

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.530
He may have mastered Yougorai,

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:28.670
but I doubt he'll threaten 
your position at Ryuukosan.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:32.140
You're trying to convince me?

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:37.970
I know. I'm simply taking 
out my frustrations on him.

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:44.150
Due to a moment's weakness, 
I made a serious mistake.

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.960
Since then, I've been unable 
to learn the Yougorai,

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:50.380
known as the symbol of 
the Tenshi's successor

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:54.060
and the thing I've desired with all my heart.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:58.480
It's my responsibility and mine alone.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:06.370
Taking out my frustrations on Chou Soran 
proves I still need more training.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:10.700
Perhaps I should apologize to him.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.690
So...

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.840
Who was your first?

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:18.450
We've known each other long enough! Tell me!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.580
I promise I'll keep it a secret!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:22.000
Please? Tell me!

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.000
Leave.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.590
Come on! It won't cost you anything!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.320
Get out of here. Go!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:26.980
I won't tell anyone!

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:28.370
At least give me a hint.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.210
Was she younger? Older?

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:32.480
<i>Who knew Reigyoku-sama had such a past?</i>

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:31.590
Someone I know?

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:35.200
Surely you can tell me now.

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:37.670
<i>It was worth making the 
trip out to Ryuukosan.</i>

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.520
I want to know all about it.

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:38.400
Go away!

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:42.540
Watching them reminds me of the past.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:46.060
They seem to be having way 
more fun than we did.

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:47.630
Hey, guys.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:50.480
Don't just sit there.

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:51.550
Drink with me.

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:52.780
Thanks.

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:53.420
I appreciate it.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.930
Brown of honesty!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.320
<b>Brown of Honesty</b>

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.180
What do you think you're doing?

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.700
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:06.450
I don't want to fight you.

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.940
I just have some questions.

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:11.010
What?

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.810
Your employees Chou Soran and Fuu Houhou...

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:18.860
Have you ever hurt them?

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.990
Hurt Soran-kun and Houhou?

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.590
What are you talking about?

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:25.240
We'd never do that!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:26.920
Okay, next question:

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:32.380
How did you come to employ 
Chou Soran and Fuu Houhou?

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.840
You have no right to know.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:38.450
But if you're asking...

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:42.250
What did you learn about Houhou?

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:49.720
If you won't talk, you must 
be prepared for a fight.

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:53.100
I'll tell you what I know.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:56.480
But first, I'd like to confirm something.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:59.120
Once I do, I'll tell you everything.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:02.610
Fine.

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:07.250
But just so you know, if we don't 
get a satisfactory answer...

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:09.740
You'll pay dearly!

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:22.020
<i>I can tell they bear no 
malice toward Fuu Houhou.</i>

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:25.010
<i>If anything, they care for her.</i>

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:32.480
<i>That's it... It's possible someone 
manipulated Houhou's mind and soul.</i>

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:36.810
<i>That's why she doesn't remember 
anything about herself.</i>

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:41.670
<i>Houhou, what happened to you?</i>

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:45.350
Hey!

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.300
Not bad, bitch.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.770
I realized something after fighting you.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:54.300
You're pretty decent at kung fu.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.210
I underestimated you, since you're a woman.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:19:58.710
Here!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:00.940
We'll have a drinking contest this time!

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:03.490
Okay.

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:05.380
After I drink this.

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:09.320
<i>Y-You can't be serious!</i>

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.880
<i>That's 56% baijiu!</i>

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:14.180
<i>No, she's challenging me!</i>

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:18.450
<i>I, Santou Danji, can't let a woman beat me!</i>

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:20.910
F-Fine.

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:24.210
Give me some of what you're having.

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:30.640
<i>I'll do it. I'll do it!</i>

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:33.040
<i>Santou Danji is a man among men!</i>

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.330
<i>I can't lose to a little girl!</i>

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:42.340
Seriously?

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:46.080
Damn it!

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.290
I'll do it! You won't beat me!

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:50.850
Was bringing Soran and Houhou 
here the right thing to do?

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.470
You worry too much.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:56.350
Let them do what they want tonight.

00:20:56.850 --> 00:21:00.810
Soran's hidden the fact that 
he's an outsider until now.

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:06.250
It's been a while since we met him, 
but I've never seen him so happy.

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:04.820
Have some more.

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:07.100
What's the big idea?!

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:10.710
He's probably been suppressing 
himself for a while.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.530
It's fine for him to cut 
loose every now and then.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:16.540
Hey, guys!

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:20.580
You wanna see my **** that badly?

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.540
Go for it, Chou Soran!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:23.830
Show us!

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.670
Go!

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:25.670
You can do it!

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.310
Go!

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.400
You're in for a special treat.

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:34.240
Here I go.

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:36.980
This is Chou Soran!

00:21:38.930 --> 00:21:40.030
I see it.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:43.280
He's marked with mystical symbols.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.780
Too bad this mysterious light is 
making everything blurry, though!

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:47.300
Mysterious light?

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:50.620
That doesn't matter.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.380
Open the eyes of your heart, and you'll see!

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:28.030
Isn't liquor delicious, Fuu Houhou?

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:27.210
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:28.030 --> 00:23:28.500
Yeah.

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:30.710
Hey, Hou-nee. Who are you drinking with?

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:33.360
Wait, what? A child's 
drinking out in the open?

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:36.000
I'm an adult! It's true!

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:38.510
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita -
The Outcast</i>, "Nouyou Insou."

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>8: Nouyou Insou</b>

00:23:38.510 --> 00:23:39.520
Don't miss it!
